/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The flowchart represents an AI-powered maternal and fetal health monitoring system that continuously tracks vital health parameters. The process begins with the system initialization, activating sensors that measure body temperature, respiration, blood pressure, ECG, blood oxygen levels, fetal kicks, and air quality. AI analyzes this data to generate personalized health recommendations and detect anomalies. If an emergency is detected, the system triggers alerts via SOS, GPS, and NFC to ensure immediate attention.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [1]
>>
